---
/**
 * Thank You (faithful cutover) — delegates to the shared PageObjectRenderer,
 * which loads the published page_thank_you object and renders its `thank_you`
 * section: the confirmation copy plus the inline script that swaps in a
 * per-form title/message from the `?form=` query param. Copy lives in the CMS
 * object; the markup and script are unchanged.
 */
import PageObjectRenderer from '~/components/cms/PageObjectRenderer.astro';
---

<PageObjectRenderer objectId="page_thank_you" />
